    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Assault is a realistic top-down stealth action game where strategic thinking and tactical prowess are your greatest weapons. Dive into intense campaigns inspired by modern military conflicts, anti-drug operations, and counter-terrorism scenarios, each mission presenting a unique challenge that demands careful planning and decisive execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of infiltration. Utilize shadows, cover, and distractions to slip past enemies, disable security systems, and achieve your objectives without raising an alarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in heart-pounding tactical combat. Coordinate with your squad, utilize realistic military tactics, and leverage the power of drones and robots to dominate the battlefield. Breach rooms in intense CQB scenarios, create diversions to outmaneuver your enemies, and deploy ground and aerial drones for reconnaissance, support, and devastating strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loadout Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout with a wide array of authentic weaponry, tactical gear, and cutting-edge technology. From silenced pistols and assault rifles to advanced drones and combat robots, your arsenal is your greatest asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics and \u0421haracter Skill Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command specialized NPC partners, each with unique skills and expertise. Direct your squad's actions, utilizing their strengths to overcome any challenge.\u00a0Gain experience by completing missions. Unlock more powerful character abilities.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Assault is a realistic top-down stealth action game where strategic thinking and tactical prowess are your greatest weapons. Dive into intense campaigns inspired by modern military conflicts, anti-drug operations, and counter-terrorism scenarios, each mission presenting a unique challenge that demands careful planning and decisive execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of infiltration. Utilize shadows, cover, and distractions to slip past enemies, disable security systems, and achieve your objectives without raising an alarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in heart-pounding tactical combat. Coordinate with your squad, utilize realistic military tactics, and leverage the power of drones and robots to dominate the battlefield. Breach rooms in intense CQB scenarios, create diversions to outmaneuver your enemies, and deploy ground and aerial drones for reconnaissance, support, and devastating strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loadout Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout with a wide array of authentic weaponry, tactical gear, and cutting-edge technology. From silenced pistols and assault rifles to advanced drones and combat robots, your arsenal is your greatest asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics and \u0421haracter Skill Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command specialized NPC partners, each with unique skills and expertise. Direct your squad's actions, utilizing their strengths to overcome any challenge.\u00a0Gain experience by completing missions. Unlock more powerful character abilities.</p>",
